OL,3,GNEWSAGoldsmiths drops Catford campus
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoldsmiths, University of London has
OL,7,Fabandoned plans to move some courses
OL,8,Ffrom Deptford to Catford in south-east
OL,9,FLondon, with Lewisham Council
OL,10,Fexpressing its "surprise and
OL,11,Ffrustration" at the decision.
OL,13,FIt was announced in January that the
OL,14,Fcouncil's Old Town Hall in Catford
OL,15,Fwould become a new campus for the
OL,16,Funiversity in what was described as a
OL,17,F"landmark partnership agreement".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
