OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGoldsmiths drops Catford campus
OL,4,Aplan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson said they had
OL,7,Fworked with Goldsmiths "in good faith"
OL,8,Fto prepare the building for students
OL,9,Ffrom September 2027, and had made
OL,10,F"significant investment" into the site.
OL,12,FGoldsmiths said it would consolidate
OL,13,Fits courses in New Cross as it focused
OL,14,Fon "creating a greener, more connected
OL,15,Fcampus environment".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
